Customer benefit
The new TTIs enable customers to identify and differentiate P2P
transaction types as part of the Mastercard MoneySend Payment and
Funding Transactions Program to support more accurate reporting,
billing, and program optimization.
What Mastercard is doing
Mastercard is introducing two TTIs within the Mastercard MoneySend
Payment and Funding Transactions Program for issuer-initiated P2P
transactions.
Background
Mastercard supports different types of P2P transactions as part of the
Mastercard MoneySend Payment and Funding Transactions Program.
Given the continued evolution of P2P payment solutions, it is important
to differentiate transaction types under P2P.
