Acquirer, Issuer: Mandated
Acquirers approved to use the new TTIs as part of the Mastercard MoneySend Payment and Funding
Transactions Program must be prepared to populate or support the new values C09 (Issuer-Initiated P2P) and
F09 (Issuer-Initiated P2P) in:
• Data Element (DE) 48 (Additional Data: Private Use), subelement 77 (Transaction Type Identifier)
• Private Data Subelement (PDS) 0043 (Transaction Type Identifier)
Issuers participating in the Mastercard MoneySend Payment and Funding Transactions Program must be
prepared to receive the new values C09 and F09 in:
• DE 48, subelement 77
• PDS 0043
Acquirers approved to use the new TTIs and issuers participating in the Mastercard MoneySend Payment and
Funding Transactions Program must:
• Support the new and modified edits
• Be aware of Integrated Product Message (IPM) Mastercard Parameter Extract (MPE) changes detailed in
this release announcement
